  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF, Angola HIV/AIDS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF, Angola HIV/AIDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of the program is to improve the survival, safety, health, and social acceptance of children and youth directly or indirectly affected by HIV/AIDS, with a particular focus on girls and young women. Specifically, UNICEF aim to enhance institutional capacity to ensure rapid, multi-sectoral and decentralized responses to the epidemic; reduce the incidence of STI-HIV/AIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
